Package: varestcf
Type: Package
Title: Focal Prediction Error Covariance and Genetic Variance
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Alan",
    family = "Pardo",
    email = "pardo.alan@inta.gob.ar",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Description: A transparent R reference for reconstructing a complete focal
    prediction error covariance block from linear mixed model equations and
    computing focal genetic variance from compatible breeding values and
    prediction error covariances. Includes synthetic acceptance tests.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: Matrix, methods, utils, stats
NeedsCompilation: no
